                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "I'm sorry to make you think that, the problems you mentioned were caused by a mistake, I fixed it with the update I released today. I actually released the game as early access, but I switched to the full version, I can say that my inexperience caused this.",
